<DTA TYPE="STRING">NOTE:  Insulation thermal conductivity (k-value) is in units of<MET> watt per meter-degree K at 93 degrees C</MET><ENG> Btu-inches/hour-square-feet-degrees F at 200 degrees F</ENG> mean temperature.</DTA>
